{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20264bI9FtP5g21793451636.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>伊朗最高領袖穆傑塔巴警告，一旦美國和以色列再襲擊伊朗，會將美以所有資產納入打擊範圍。</p><p></p><p>穆傑塔巴發表聲明說，他會見了伊朗武裝力量高級指揮官，下令針對美國和以色列，可能會發動的襲擊，必須予以即時、有力而且不受地理限制的回應。</p><p></p><p>穆傑塔巴還要求伊朗武裝力量更新目標清單，將美國與以色列所有資產納入打擊範圍，他還下令增加生產偵察、支援和作戰行動所需的彈藥和武器。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:37.037102+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T11:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.797689+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:26.636152+00:00","content_hash":"02929007ab8316ca6cf3e4790b6a1a26902a835daf94476f99a744018a540502","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:37.037102+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}